( dx7_tables.fy - the DX7's lookup tables, as Dexed's msfa engine has
  them [github asb2m10/dexed Source/msfa, Apache-2.0: env.cc, dx7note.cc,
  pitchenv.cc, lfo.cc].  Measured from hardware by the msfa authors; the
  FM-86 voice [fm86_voice.fy] reads them at note-on and per block.

    dx-sol       output / EG level 0..99 -> the envelope's scale
                 [Env::scaleoutlevel: levellut under 20, else 28 + L]
    dx-vel       velocity >> 1 -> velocity_data
    dx-expcurve  keyboard level scaling group -> exp_scale_data
    dx-statics   rate 0..76 -> hold time of a flat segment, samples at 44.1k
    dx-prate     pitch EG rate -> pitchenv_rate
    dx-plevel    pitch EG level -> pitchenv_tab [1/32 octave]
    dx-lfo       LFO speed -> lfoSource [Hz-ish, x 4437500000 / 2^32]

  Every body indexes a literal list: `i` arrives as a float. )

table: dx-sol 99
  f>i dup 20 < [ [ 0 5 9 13 17 20 23 25 27 29 31 33 35 37 39 41 42 43 45 46 ] swap qnth ] [ 28 + ] ifte
  i>f
;

